OL,3,AUkraine doesn't deserve 'respite',
OL,4,ARussian FM says, as Zelensky says he'd
OL,5,Asupport Trump's energy ceasefire
OL,6,
OL,7,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky says
OL,8,FRussia hit a power plant in Ukraine
OL,9,F"immediately after" Donald Trump
OL,10,Fannounced what he called an energy
OL,11,Fceasefire
OL,13,F"It's clear Putin doesn't read Truth
OL,14,FSocial," says Zelensky, referring to
OL,15,Fthe US president's social media post on
OL,16,FSunday - our Russia editor outlines
OL,17,Fwho's saying what
OL,19,FZelensky says Ukraine is willing to
OL,20,Fback an energy truce if Moscow does the
OL,21,Fsame, adding it could "become a major
OL,22,Fstep toward ending the war"
