OL,6,
OL,7,FA Kremlin spokesman says: "As soon as
OL,8,Fwe have something to say on the matter,
OL,9,Fwe will inform you"
OL,11,FTrump has been urging Ukraine to stop
OL,12,Fstrikes on Russian oil infrastructure
OL,13,Fso Moscow can fulfil a recently struck
OL,14,Fdeal to release diesel to the US and
OL,15,Fthe global market
